From: Paul Nel <paul@fashionpass.com>
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 18:00:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Camera: Use A16 open API for alternate primary

Android 16 removed the single-argument Camera constructor. Route the compatibility override through the public open(int) path so context and rotation compatibility are initialized.

Generated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)

Co-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
Change-Id: I655b0fbbf2436b5ab4e2b76d4b025e122dc152d4
---
 core/java/android/hardware/Camera.java | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/core/java/android/hardware/Camera.java b/core/java/android/hardware/Camera.java
index 5a99bf73ddcb..bbcafde7287e 100644
--- a/core/java/android/hardware/Camera.java
+++ b/core/java/android/hardware/Camera.java
@@ -520,7 +520,7 @@ public class Camera {
     public static Camera open() {
         int altPrimaryCamera = SystemProperties.getInt("persist.sys.alt_primary_camera", -1);
         if (altPrimaryCamera > 0) {
-            return new Camera(altPrimaryCamera);
+            return open(altPrimaryCamera);
         }
 
         int numberOfCameras = getNumberOfCameras();
